title: 'Decided: the order is the root authors'', the user''s, then each foreign owner''s by the config''s order; a perspective that would change nothing is skipped.'
pid: 6c3cc381-8f3f-4d17-9d5c-8f181169ad07
body: |2-
  Fixed ranks make "next" well defined however the set changes (below).
  The user comes first because the switch began as Jeff's way to see his
  own. Showing a perspective that changes nothing would only plant a
  mark that means nothing; the old rule, that a switch to the user's is
  refused in a view whose every root is the user's, is its special case.
